  sourcePath: 'src/pages/equipment/power-generation-system.astro',
  path: '/equipment/power-generation-system',
  headline: "Power Generation System: Diesel-Electric Rigs, SCR",
  description: "How a rig's power generation system works: diesel generators, the diesel-electric (SCR/VFD) model most modern rigs use, and why it replaced direct mechanical drive.",
